      "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\">Quick Links</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><a title=\"Go to Vocera Support\" href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/acute-care/vocera/support.html\">Vocera Support</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><a title=\"Go to Vocear Easter eggs\" href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/acute-care/vocera/support/easter-eggs.html\">Vocera Easter Eggs</a></span><br>\n</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><a title=\"Go to Vocera voice commands\" href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/acute-care/vocera/support/voice-commands.html\">Vocera Voice Commands</a></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\">Tech Support</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Toll Free:&nbsp;<a title=\"Call (800) 473-3971\" href=\"tel:8004733971\">(800) 473-3971</a><br>\n or <a title=\"Call (408) 882-5700\" href=\"tel:1-4088825700\">(408) 882-5700</a><br>\n </span></span><a title=\"Email Vocera Support\" href=\"vcsupport@stryker.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">vcsupport@stryker.com</span></span></a></p>\n",
